<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2015/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>burrow</id>
    <version>0.1.0</version>
    <title>Burrow</title>
    <authors>vanshcodeworks</authors>
    <owners>vanshcodeworks</owners>
    <projectUrl>https://github.com/vanshcodeworks/burrow</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vanshcodeworks/burrow/main/docs/assets/burrow-icon.png</iconUrl>
    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/vanshcodeworks/burrow</projectSourceUrl>
    <docsUrl>https://github.com/vanshcodeworks/burrow</docsUrl>
    <mailingListUrl>https://github.com/vanshcodeworks/burrow/discussions</mailingListUrl>
    <bugTrackerUrl>https://github.com/vanshcodeworks/burrow/issues</bugTrackerUrl>
    <tags>developer-tools local-development postgresql nats caddy rust windows development-environment</tags>
    <summary>Native Windows local development environment manager</summary>
    <description>
      Burrow runs services from one burrow.toml as native Windows processes, with
      automatic ports, generated environment variables, health-checked startup,
      verified package downloads, snapshots, and a live terminal dashboard. It does
      not require Docker, a virtual machine, or WSL.

      Features:
      - One burrow.toml to define your entire local stack
      - Native Windows processes (no Docker/WSL required for built-in services)
      - Stable per-project ports
      - Health-gated service startup with dependency graph
      - Verified package downloads with SHA-256 verification
      - Loopback reverse proxy with *.localhost routing and WebSocket passthrough
      - Live terminal dashboard (burrow top)
      - Full-directory snapshots with journaled restore
      - Read-only diagnostics (burrow doctor) with remedies

      Built-in packages: PostgreSQL 16, NATS 2.15, Caddy 2.11.
      Other services run from your PATH or through an optional container fallback.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>
      Initial release of Burrow v0.1.0
      - Native Windows process supervision with Job Objects
      - Built-in packages: PostgreSQL 16, NATS 2.15, Caddy 2.11
      - Loopback reverse proxy with *.localhost routing
      - Verified package downloads with SHA-256
      - Content-addressed cache with resumable downloads
      - Live terminal dashboard (burrow top)
      - Diagnostics with burrow doctor
      - Full-directory snapshots with restore
    </releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright (c) vanshcodeworks</copyright>
    <licenseUrl>https://github.com/vanshcodeworks/burrow/blob/main/LICENSE-MIT</licenseUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\burrow.exe" target="tools\burrow.exe" />
  </files>
</package>
